  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the grill to medium-high heat",
    "Cut the fish into 1-inch pieces and season with salt, black pepper, and paprika",
    "Thread the fish onto skewers, leaving a small space between each piece",
    "Brush the grill with olive oil to prevent sticking",
    "Grill the fish for 8-10 minutes, turning occasionally, until cooked through",
    "Meanwhile, mix the yogurt, lemon juice, and minced garlic in a bowl",
    "Serve the fish kebabs with the creamy yogurt sauce",
    "Garnish with additional lemon wedges and parsley if desired"
